{"id":6,"date":"2019-10-26T20:14:55","date_gmt":"2019-10-26T19:14:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/latentfaces.feymore.com\/front-page"},"modified":"2023-05-24T23:01:32","modified_gmt":"2023-05-24T22:01:32","slug":"front-page","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/","title":{"rendered":"Rahi Da Fey"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-huge-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">Releases<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">Rahi is available at reverbnation, twitter and facebook. He released an instrumental album from the label at www.dugdugi.com . Released nine albums from then.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-huge-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">Recent Updates<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">Working on a new instrumental album. Theoretically detached from live shows. Working back and forth in studios with instrumentals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background has-huge-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">Bio<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"background-color:#eeff5b\">I have been playing guitar my whole life and have learned many things from many people. My training began when I was 16 years old in 2000 A.D. After some time from some famous guitarists. I play bass, electronic keyboards, guitars currently. I&#8217;m pursuing my dream in this profession and have already written many songs and books.. I am currently working with my main band &#8220;Advent Flair.&#8221;. We didn&#8217;t do a great deal of gigs, but we worked a lot in the studio.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Releases Rahi is available at reverbnation, twitter and facebook. He released an instrumental album from the label at www.dugdugi.com . Released nine albums from then.&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":34,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"ngg_post_thumbnail":0,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-6","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6"}],"version-history":[{"count":18,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3573,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions\/3573"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/34"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/latentfaces.localhost:8080\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}